    "turn_idx": 127,
    "turn_text": "Wow. I mean, incredible. I mean, I just can't even imagine. And, you know, it's difficult when you have a parent that's been so visible, so historic, all those things. I mean, look at her at her funeral. She had the president. I mean, you know, she had the vice president, the previous president. I mean, Stevie Wonder, I mean, I mean, you know, who has all that? Well, your mom does. Yeah. But, you know, it's like, How do you ever top that right? I mean you just can't other than you just you just do your best to live her legacy",
